# MAP-TRAILER-NEXT: {{^}}  Token Module!Entry Symbol{{$}}
# MAP-TRAILER-NOT:  {{.}}

## x86_64 Linux: an empty asm barrier and a signal fence.
# RUN: msil-ld asm.o -o asm.exe -Map=asm.map 2>&1 | count 0
